Department after he tells her mother, ''My
head is light, and | feel like falling down.'' On
examination, his blood pressure is 80/50
mmHg and he has a regular pulse rate of 60
bpm. An EGG is obtained which is shown in
the following photograph. Which one of the
following is the next best step in
management?','{"A":"A Give him adenosine.","B":"B Give him amiodarone.","C":"Cc Give him atropine.","D":"Db Immerse his face in cold water and\nmassage his carotid sinus.","E":"F Cardioversion with DC shock."}',NULL,NULL,'{"source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 CVS (1).pdf","supporting_pages":[296],"source_qid":null,"duplicate_group_id":"exact-c4c99f116216","duplicate_sources":[{"record_id":"46823cf5af1dfdded28b","record_type":"text_mcq","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 CVS (1).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 CVS (1).pdf","source_page":296,"source_qid":null}],"parser_version":"2.7.1-parser-only-conservative-staging-2026-09-22","parser_mode":"v27_same_page_five_structural","text_method":"tesseract","visual_asset":null,"asset_preview_url":null}',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'needs_verification','[]','medium','{"record_id":"46823cf5af1dfdded28b","source_file":"AMEDEX 2025 CVS (1).pdf","source_relative_path":"AMEDEX 2025.09更新包/AMEDEX 2025 CVS (1).pdf","source_year":2025,"source_page":296,"supporting_pages":[296],"source_qid":null,"domain_hint":"Cardiology","stem":"A 4-year-old boy is brought to the Emergency\nDepartment after he tells her mother, ''My\nhead is light, and | feel like falling down.'' On\nexamination, his blood pressure is 80/50\nmmHg and he has a regular pulse rate of 60\nbpm. An EGG is obtained which is shown in\nthe following photograph. Which one of the\nfollowing is the next best step in\nmanagement?","options":{"A":"A Give him adenosine.","B":"B Give him amiodarone.","C":"Cc Give him atropine.","D":"Db Immerse his face in cold water and\nmassage his carotid sinus.","E":"F Cardioversion with DC shock."},"source_answer":null,"source_explanation":null,"source_answer_status":"pending_import","current_answer":null,"current_answer_status":"needs_verification","current_evidence":[],"currentness_risk":"medium","currentness_keywords":["age","management"],"likely_visual_question":true,"parser_confidence":"medium","parser_mode":"v27_s