clinic with a rash on her back. The rash
appeared two months ago as a 3x4 cm oval
patch on her upper back that later on was
followed by an eruption of smaller spots with
occasional itching. The spots are paler than
the surrounding skin. She has tried tanning
oils and salons but the rash persists. On
examination, there are multiple 3- to 5-mm
macules on her back distributed in a
