emergency department by ambulance
paramedics after he sustained a stab wound
in the chest in a street fight. On examination,
he as a knife stuck in the left hemithorax. The
patient is awake, oriented and cooperative.
His blood pressure is 110/65mmHg, hear rate
100 bpm and respiratory rate 18 breaths per
minute. There are no raised neck or forehead
